        <div className="mt-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.035] p-4"><div className="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><span className="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#64717c]">Library status</span><span className="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#79c7a0]"><span className="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#79c7a0]" /> LIVE</span></div><div className="font-mono text-[13px] font-bold text-white">01 game · 30 guides</div><p className="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#7c8790]">R.E.P.O. is live. More game guides can share the same structure.</p></div>
